      "title": "Emacs: shell injection vulnerability in gnu emacs via custom \"man\" uri scheme",
      "summary": "A command injection flaw was found in the text editor Emacs. It could allow a remote, unauthenticated attacker to execute arbitrary shell commands on a vulnerable system. Exploitation is possible by tricking users into visiting a specially crafted website or an HTTP URL with a redirect.",
